# Raw transcript-derived corpora. These carry unscrubbed PII by construction —
# the transcripts hold 49 distinct SSN-shaped values. hooks/pre-commit is the
# boundary, but a file that never gets staged cannot be leaked by an amend, and
# `gt modify -a` behaves like `git add -A`.
baseline/prompts-clean.tsv
baseline/prompts-raw.tsv
baseline/census.tsv
*-prompts.tsv
*-raw.tsv
